            "description": "The **31** `ClusterAuthorizationFailed`: a share lookup is authorized as `CLUSTER_ACTION` on the **cluster** (`KafkaApis.getCoordinator` @ 3.9.2), where a group lookup needs `DESCRIBE` on the group (the **30** for the same principal) and a transaction lookup `DESCRIBE` on the transactional id (the **53**). The share coordinator is a broker-internal thing in Kafka 3.9, which is why an ordinary client principal may not even ask where it is; the check runs **after** the version gate, so the same request at the version 5 is the 42 for this principal too.",
